      <pubDate>Tue, 15 Sep 2026 18:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>&lt;div&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/483874a864a269630f446b18a7f685e33f6ef74b.png?auto=compress,format&amp;h=340&amp;w=1200&amp;s=881780b514f483cac5db0732102f0136"&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/083d3305d782c41945da1b50a8cbd5deae483764.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=crop&amp;h=600&amp;w=1200&amp;s=263577fbce4ece5181f8802f4cd12821"&gt;&lt;h2&gt;High fantasies, tech dystopias, and beyond&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;If you’ve been looking to expand your tabletop gaming horizons, look no further than this bundle of rulebooks, resource guides, and adventures set in two of the fantastical worlds of publisher Son of Oak! Brave the wilds of story-driven rustic fantasy TTRPG &lt;em&gt;Legend in the Mist&lt;/em&gt;, an adventure steeped in folktales and magic! Or look to the future with cyberpunk fantasy &lt;em&gt;Metro:Otherscape&lt;/em&gt;, where spirits and gods grant powers to tech-addled mortals! This bundle includes everything you need to start your campaign in either (or both!) RPG, from setting manuals to maps, character packs, soundtracks, and more! Dive into a new realm of adventure by grabbing this bundle at the price of your choice, and support the World Wildlife Fund with your purchase!  &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style="color: #ef9741;"&gt;Codes are redeemable through the DriveThruRPG website.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#0"&gt;Pay $5 to unlock!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#legendinthemist_halloweencreaturepack"&gt;Legend In The Mist - Halloween Creature Pack&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#legendinthemist_wintercreaturepack"&gt;Legend In The Mist - Winter Creature Pack&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#bt10"&gt;Pay $10 or more to also unlock!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#otherscapecharacterpack"&gt;:Otherscape Character Pack&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#otherscapecharacterpack2"&gt;:Otherscape Character Pack 2&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#otherscapemcscreen"&gt;:Otherscape MC Screen&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#bt18"&gt;Pay $18 or more to also unlock!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#legendinthemist_corebook"&gt;Legend In The Mist - Core Book&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#metrootherscapecorebook"&gt;Metro:Otherscape Core Book&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#legendinthemist_heartsofravensdalesettingbook"&gt;Legend In The Mist - Hearts of Ravensdale Setting Book&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#tokyootherscapesettingbook"&gt;Tokyo:Otherscape Setting Book&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#otherscapeactiondatabase"&gt;:Otherscape Action Database&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#legendinthemist_actiongrimoire"&gt;Legend In The Mist - Action Grimoire&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#legendinthemist_peddlerscartcollection"&gt;Legend In The Mist - Peddler's Cart Collection&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#legendinthemist_characterpack"&gt;Legend In The Mist - Character Pack&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#legendinthemist_scenemapsandtokens"&gt;Legend In The Mist - Scene Maps &amp; Tokens&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#legendinthemist_thetwilightdeck"&gt;Legend In The Mist - The Twilight Deck&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#legendinthemist_sounctrack"&gt;Legend In The Mist - Soundtrack&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#legendinthemist_narratorsscreen"&gt;Legend In The Mist - Narrator's Screen&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h2 id="0"&gt;Pay $5 to unlock!&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 id="legendinthemist_halloweencreaturepack"&gt;&lt;a id="legendinthemist_halloweencreaturepack"&gt;Legend In The Mist - Halloween Creature Pack&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/261c2c19efb2fdc2234bd5491f0b4293038e42d8.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=32f31dd3919bf9b7be8f5b5c42142af9"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;As the harvest begins to wane and frost creeps down from the Witchwood, the villagers of the Upper Hartland know to leave tributes and keep their doors locked tight. The Harvest Hag is coming. She arrives at twilight leading swarms of vermin, carrying an empty cornucopia in her hands, and harboring a hunger as deep as winter’s long shadow.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This seasonal pack brings five new spooky Challenges to your next Legend in the Mist campaign!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;• Harvest Hag - A Creature of Twilight, obsessed with hoarding the land’s bounty for the coming winter. • Corn Maze - A festive tradition turns treacherous. By day, villagers race to solve the twisting paths. But, by night, not all that stalk the rows are harmless. • Black Cat - Felines are tied to fate itself, not misfortune. These cats become vessels for wayward spirits who wish to teach lessons in humility. • Haunting Lantern - A relic from Old Gwyrdolin, once used to teach Thaumaturges to face their fears.  • Witch Trial - Fear and suspicion stir frightened villagers to turn on one another, desperate for someone to blame, spiraling to a spectacle of furious accusations.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Each entry is crafted for Legend in the Mist, perfect for adding a touch of rustic horror to your table this Halloween, or any time the mists feel close.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="legendinthemist_wintercreaturepack"&gt;&lt;a id="legendinthemist_wintercreaturepack"&gt;Legend In The Mist - Winter Creature Pack&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/4507b96d9780c7d6d701cdc76ccfb6639490226d.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=c93c6e6e306fe84da2fb4b3da4ea015f"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Snow blankets the Dales, yet the winter silence is not a peaceful one. Hearthfires burn lower. Doors hang heavy with ice. Winds whisper of spirits born of loneliness, hunger, and forgotten traditions. Those who travel the frozen plains speak of unseen shadows clutching at warmth, of playful gifts turning cruel, and of a kindly old magician whose laughter lasts just a little too long in the dark…&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This seasonal pack brings five chilling Winter Challenges to your next Legend in the Mist campaign!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;• Wintershade – A servant of the Winter King, haunting doorways and window frames, freezing homes from the outside in until its victims are too numb to scream. • Myling – The restless spirit of one lost to winter’s cruelty, rebuilding its tiny body from reed and wood again and again until its frozen corpse is found and laid to rest. • Ice Crossing – A deadly environmental threat. A frozen lake, a cracking sheet of ice, and the pitch-black water beneath, waiting to drag the unwary down into the cold. • Gift of Painted Boulders – A beloved seasonal tradition turned vexing mystery. A “gift” is not what it seems, and recovering what’s been stolen becomes a puzzle of pride, patience, and community secrets. • Visit of the Merry Magician – A cheerful entertainer adored by all… whose enchanted toys slowly poison townsfolk into selfishness and mistrust, unraveling the very heart of the community.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Each entry is crafted for Legend in the Mist, perfect for adding a bite of winter peril, eerie mystery, and folklore-fueled wonder to your table—whether for a festive seasonal tale or any adventure set beneath snow-laden skies.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2 id="bt10"&gt;Pay $10 or more to also unlock!&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 id="otherscapecharacterpack"&gt;&lt;a id="otherscapecharacterpack"&gt;:Otherscape Character Pack&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/6cb44cafdbde87b9f98a00a403bfb006097d9e59.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=347faaf79450e2f4a1b30ae2612495b0"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Ten (10) beautifully-illustrated pregen character folios.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The :Otherscape Character Pack contains 10 character folios with a graphic summary of the game rules and dice roll outcomes, and suggestions for cool tag combos.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The :Otherscape Character Pack features two crews of futuristic mystics, grizzled mercenaries, and transhuman entities.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;METRO Crew:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;• Dokkaebi, a goblin-powered hacker and social engineer • Kerberoz, a drone operator blessed by the mythic three-headed underworld hound • Ocelot, a cartel assassin wielding a meso-american mythic weapon • Shams, a Sufi freedom-fighter with command over spirits • Valkyrie, a cyborg corporate soldier wielding an adaptive weapon&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;TOKYO Crew:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;• Genji, an Onmyoji (sorcerer) detective bringing balance to the spirit world • Horishi, a self-modding tattoo artist who can make her art come to life • Shikigami, a spirit that exists in cyberspace and inhabits technology • Unagi, a scavanger wil eel powers that hunts after Sources • Wilson, an expat military expert with the strentgh of an Oni (ogre)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* The set includes full color folios as well as gray-scale printer-friendly versions of all character folios.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="otherscapecharacterpack2"&gt;&lt;a id="otherscapecharacterpack2"&gt;:Otherscape Character Pack 2&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/248f853470895937350bc0afac08bdafab399927.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=452c2c5292ee1ffa9068f79879e7200d"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Fifteen (15) beautifully-illustrated pregen character folios.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The :Otherscape Character Pack 2 contains 15 character folios with a graphic summary of the game rules and dice roll outcomes, and suggestions for cool tag combos.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The :Otherscape Character Pack 2 features characters conceived by :Otherscape fans, including underworld hired guns, occultist hackers, and gene-altered shapeshifters.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;IMMORTAL Crew:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;• Aegis, an emo youth with an oversized sword  • Akka-Dakka, a mechanic and musciaion with the power to capture gods • Alex Arai, an art student and illusionist inspired by the Cheshire Cat • Bahe Black, a hacker who can manipulate data like water • Cutter, a street surgeon and survivalist imbued with the Sasquatch • Devilish T, a club owner who made a deal with the devil • DJ Dreaming, a DJ whose music can make people go wild • Dr. John Trask, a scientist who splices animal genes into his DNA • Kash Black, a gangster powered by a Navajo monster hunter • Kassandro, a savy executive with the power of prophecy, and gadgets • Loremonger, an archivist of forbidden knowledge who often puts it to use • Noriko, an assassin with the power of electricity • Snowcat, a street warrior imbued with the powers of an ice dragon • Toshiro, an urchin who can tap the deceptive racoon dog • Twiceborn, a woman with two heads, both of which are clones of her own persoanlity&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* The set includes full color folios as well as gray-scale printer-friendly versions of all character folios.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="otherscapemcscreen"&gt;&lt;a id="otherscapemcscreen"&gt;:Otherscape MC Screen&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/b8bdb8e4bc5a945168877e3e8f7df35788893346.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=b9ca575e327e835b678c39a72a03df1c"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;All the rules, tips, and suggestions an :Otherscape MC needs handy.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This three-panel landscape illustrated MC (GM) screen, featuring signature :Otherscape art and characters, contains useful rules summaries, suggested conditions (status) lists, and handy ideas for in-game Threats and Consequences.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2 id="bt18"&gt;Pay $18 or more to also unlock!&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 id="legendinthemist_corebook"&gt;&lt;a id="legendinthemist_corebook"&gt;Legend In The Mist - Core Book&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/9b41a9ba0e26f1309515d16160dc15112a00a36b.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=146315ac8fa1a9dc528c6fd2c8759a1c"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Everything You Need To Create And Play A Legend In the Mist!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Legend in the Mist is a narrative-first RPG for players who want a fantasy role-playing experience that feels like a folktale, with heartfelt moments, exciting conflicts, and gasp-worthy character-altering consequences.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Spin a fireside tale of villagers and other unlikely heroes setting out on a quest into a greater unknown world, rife with peril, magic, and mystery.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Winner of *SIX* 2026 ENnie Awards including: Best Game (Silver), Best Rules (Silver), Best Production Values (Silver), Best Interior Art (Gold), Best Supplement (Action Grimoire, Gold), Best Free Game (Comic Tutorial, Silver)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;RUSTIC FANTASY&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Legend In The Mist is inspired by works of fiction about everyday heroes from rural communities that embark on a journey such as The Lord Of The Rings, Princess Mononoke, Wheel of Time, and even The Wind In The Willows.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;• Unlikely heroes: Start off in your village or remote region and contend with everyday problems, just before a darker danger looms. • Journeys in the countryside and wilderness: scout, explore, traverse landscapes dark or beautiful, discover ruins, or find forgotten landmarks. • Camping and fellowship: Set camp, train, craft items and brew potions, and build relationships with your fellow travelers. • Dangerous encounters: Face unscrupulous travelers and strange creatures, and learn about their sorcerous ways and weaknesses. • Ancient lore, crafty factions: Discover the great world beyond, the powers that be, and the dark past that started it all. • More than just battles: Overcome challenges through battle, magic, wits, physical feats, charm, cunning - or love, gossip, or great cooking - anything is possible. • Carve your fate: Make hard choices that will shape you. Will you become the hero to save the realm, or just a traveler passing by? The choice is yours. "&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;THE GAME&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Uniquely, Legend In The Mist is played using only tags and two dice (2d6), with no stats, calculations, or complex rules to memorize, making it perfect for players who love story in their games, and for newcomers to the hobby.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;• Easy to learn • Based on words, not stats, memorization, and calculations • Story-first, Heroes change and evolve based on your roleplay choices • Free your creativity with limitless character creation and actions • As tactical or as cozy as you want it to be • Play in any setting • Built-in solo and co-op modes • Special rules for journeys and exploration • Flexible magic system&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;THE CORE BOOK&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Split for convenience into two volumes (both included in a single PDF file) - the Hero and the Narrator - the core book contains everything you need for endless rustic adventures:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Volume I - the Hero (240p): • The Tutorial: a 50-page comic book adventure that teaches you the basics of the game. • Chapter #1: Hero &amp;amp; Fellowship Creation is packed with 30 ready-to-play character Tropes and +150 Theme Kits as well as 20 customizable Themebooks. • Chapter #2: How To Play explains the rules of the game, how to take actions and overcome Challenges, as well as how to evolve your Hero. • Chapter #3: The Secret of Magic explains how to portray magic in the game with 8 detailed Ways of Magic.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Volume II - the Narrator (256p): • Chapter #4: The Narrator’s Role is a detailed guide on how to run a game, how to design adventures and series, and how to create your own Ways of Magic. • Chapter #5: The Satchel of Perils contains over 70 Challenges (adversaries) and 20 Journeys, a guide on how to create them, and a starter adventure. • The Oracle is a set of tools for running solo or co-op games.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="metrootherscapecorebook"&gt;&lt;a id="metrootherscapecorebook"&gt;Metro:Otherscape Core Book&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/fac5770fdcf51339f46461401944dbb9fdffd9a1.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=d74517a8ff7030ae8474a336f243f35a"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;:Otherscape is a fantasy-cyberpunk role-playing game that combines supernatural powers inspired by mythology and legend with the gritty neon-lit streets of a sprawling futuristic Megacity.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;It takes your game group on a rollercoaster ride of gunfights, vehicle chases, cyberspace heists, urban wasteland exploration, clashes of mythology and technology, faction wars, and philosophical questions about the nature of being human — and how to transcend it.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Mythic-Powered Mercs&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;You play as a crew of opeartives, hired-guns, or survivors caught in the new global arms race between corporations, collapsing governments, and crime syndicates, all rushing to secure Sources of mythical power and cutting-edge tech. You could be:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;• A sourcerous gunslinger shooting enchancted bullets • A chromed-up Norse cyborg wielding the power of Mjölnir • A spirit of knowledge revelling in cyberspace • A scavenger and smuggler of illegal Sources, exlporing the urban wilds • A corporate executive who strikes bargains with the Devil's seal And much more!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;A Perfect Mix of Cinematic and Tactical&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;:Otherscape is powered by the Mist Engine, an improved and streamlined version of the cinematic City of Mist engine:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;• Creativity unchained with characters made of keywords, not predefined stats, allowing you to create any imaginable character, tech, or magic system. • No more endless subsystems to memorize - resolve all actions with one simple yet highly customizable roll. • Move seamlessly between narrative and tactical action resolution, keeping the story moving and the conflicts rich and rewarding. • Choices transform gameplay: Characters transform based on their motivations and roleplay, and can evolve into different types of being such as cyborg, singularity, or transhuman, which endow them with new power sets and abilities.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Play in the :Otherscape setting or any cyberpunk setting of your choice; this open system is easily adapatable to any universe.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;What's In This Book?&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Metro:Otherscape is the complete :Otherscape corebook with everything you need to learn and play the game: setting, rules, rapid and custom character creation and evolution, guides for the Master of Ceremonies, and plenty of ready-to-use content, including a full “learn-as-you-play” starter job (adventure).&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;• //IMAGINE describes the :Otherscape proto setting, a mythic-futuristic world designed with room for you to make it your own, including examples and story hooks for characters, crews, corporations, Sources, Megacities, and more. • //PLAY delves into the game rules, both for players and the MC, including all the options, suggestions, and examples. • //CREATE offers a set of tools to create new player characters, crews, series, and Megacities, with plenty of ready-to-use content, Rapid and Custom creation modes, and a loadout tag catalog. • //RUN has guides and resources for the MC on how to run the game and how to design your own series, jobs, and Challenges – with a pool of Challenges to start from. • Strings Attached is a starter job your group can play on your first few sessions, which teaches the game as you play.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="legendinthemist_heartsofravensdalesettingbook"&gt;&lt;a id="legendinthemist_heartsofravensdalesettingbook"&gt;Legend In The Mist - Hearts of Ravensdale Setting Book&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/34c5c50e203568ff94fbf9752e15b3ec1299ff6f.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=a0db320a50405030e26ab65f0b68032f"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;A fresh new world of cozy rustic fantasy, countryside journeys, and ancient eerie mysteries...&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Hearts of Ravensdale is a setting book for the Legend in the Mist RPG that explores the Dales, a remote mountain region of rustic villages, folk magic, and mysterious Creatures of Twilight.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The Dales is a land of rustic fantasy, where ordinary village folk - framers, hunters, herbalists, and peddlers - live close to nature and to the Unseen, the hidden home of the Creatures of Twilight. A peace that lasted generations is about to come to an end, and the people of the Dales will soon find in themselves facing greater challenges. It is time to embark on a journey across the Dales, discover the truth about the mysterious kingdom of Old Gwyrdolin, learn the folk magic of the Oldways, and face strange Creatures -- all in a bid to save your home.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Hearts of Ravensdale takes the narrative system of Legend In The Mist and builds an enchanting, rugged, and lore-rich Rustic Fantasy setting for you to explore – on your own or with friends.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;What's Included:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;• Solo/co-op support for the entire book&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;• Deep lore for each Dale with cultures, landmarks, rumors, and legends to explore&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;• 30 new Tropes and 120 new Theme Kits for creating rustic Dalish or supernatural heroes &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;• Cooking and Crafting rules&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;• Oldways, folk magic path for crafting charms, rituals, herbalism, and shrines&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;• Thaumaturgy, a secret, unlockable path for more powerful cultivation-based magic&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;• Over 70 Challenges and Creatures of Twilight with meaningful backstories and secrets you can discover&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;• Wake Of The Oldways, a full campaign: Seven rustic adventures of Dalish everyday and Twilight magic, played as one-shots or campaign&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="tokyootherscapesettingbook"&gt;&lt;a id="tokyootherscapesettingbook"&gt;Tokyo:Otherscape Setting Book&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/53339379d9cb0b74bb844dc6dbea65af6775fc0f.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=0f483a9e292a39581847f61818b0ac34"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Kitsune powerbrokers. Oni gangsters. Kami assassins. Step into the neon-lit torii gate and discover a Tokyo where tech and myth blend and clash in a battle for humanity's future.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Tokyo:Otherscape is a setting book for the :Otherscape role-playing game that provides the MC and players with everything they need to jump right into a game on the dangerous, haunted streets of the Tokyo Megacity.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;In this fictional dystopian Tokyo, rogue AIs, nanotech disasters, greedy zaibatsus, and Yakuza intertwine with oni, kami, yōkai, onmyōji, and other supernatural beings of Japanese legend.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;WHAT’S IN THIS BOOK?&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;• //TOKYO MEGACITY -- Setting Information including trends, locations, organizations, a guide to local Mythoi, unique tech, language glossary, and more.  • //BUSHI LIFE -- New Player Options with dozens of new theme kits and Specials for playing Tokyo Megacity characters such as an otaku Neo-Samurai, a wasteland-dwelling Yamabushi, or a kitsune powerbroker, as well as a rich Tokyo Street Catalog of weapons, augmentations, drones, and magical Sources. • //YŌKAI DATABASE -- A Database of Yōkai with 60 ready-to-use Challenges and Power Sets from the Megacity, focusing on supernatural beings prowling the streets, integrated into cyberspace, and operating in the criminal underworld, as well as non-yōkai adversaries. • //KEY PLAYERS -- Ten fleshed-out factions and subcultures for your PCs to fight, negotiate with, or join, including a sun-powered Taiyō SolarTech, the age-old Bureau of Onmyō, the magic-wielding Yakuza clans, the Oni Motorcycle Gangs and more. Each faction has its own Challenges, theme kits, and catalog. • //JOBS BULLETIN -- A Collection of Jobs (Adventures) with five short jobs set in iconic Tokyo Megacity locations (hi-tech dream therapy clinic, cyberspace bullet train, nanotech disaster ruins, yōkai-infested flooded tunnels, and gang-run bathhouse) as well as a full length job – A Bridge Too Far – where your crew will be pitted against otherworldly forces and faced with a transcendental transhumanist dilemma that could impact the future of the entire Megacity&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="otherscapeactiondatabase"&gt;&lt;a id="otherscapeactiondatabase"&gt;:Otherscape Action Database&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/f8e5e6787bfee3637905fae0d413c8ce3b6cd55f.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=869433adb12489c3ba61b5676ff04fe3"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Reference Guide for limitless Player Actions in the Mythic Cyberpunk RPG&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The Action Database is a supplement to the core rules of :Otherscape, offering an encyclopedic collection of suggestions for typical player actions and how the game’s rolls and Effects can be used to resolve them. It can be used by players and MCs alike for inspiration for actions and Consequences, or as a quick reference on how to resolve specific actions and situations during the game.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;With its open-ended tag-based rules, :Otherscape allows you to simulate and resolve any imaginable action that players could want to take in a scene. From hacking a simple lock to piloting drones, from brewing potions to summoning spirits, from driving a getaway car to shooting rockets at a giant spider tank – all actions of a mythic cyberpunk series can be resolved using the same rules and with a single roll, making way for the story you want to tell.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Among the action categories covered in this book:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;• Combat actions, including attacks, tactical actions, support actions, and different types of defense. • Cyberspace actions including data manipulation, hacking, virtual reality shaping, and harnessing. • Exploration &amp;amp; survival actions, including navigating terrain and hazards, scouting, sneaking, as well as treating injury and recovery. • Mythos powers actions including working with Sources, spellcasting, summoning, transformation, communing with Mythoi, and many other types of magic. • Social interaction actions including deception, persuasion, managing reputation, leadership, and manipulation, as well as a range of business transactions. • Spycraft actions such as surveilling, shadowing, sneaking, and gathering information. • Tech &amp;amp; gear actions including building, upgrading, and repairing tech, operating devices, vehicles, and drones, and tampering with tech.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="legendinthemist_actiongrimoire"&gt;&lt;a id="legendinthemist_actiongrimoire"&gt;Legend In The Mist - Action Grimoire&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/9bf88c8c3ef342379881758a6cec59b12eca5b16.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=1b3bd059554ed66d6405a4474bd51639"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Suggestions and inspiration for actions in Legend in the Mist!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Winner of BEST SUPPLEMENT (GOLD) 2026 ENnie Awards!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;A handy reference guide with dozens of suggestions for actions Heroes can take in a rustic fantasy game, their Effects, and their Consequences.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;With its open-ended tag-based rules, Legend in the Mist allows you to simulate and resolve any imaginable action that players could want to take in a scene. From breaking into a locked chest to riding a mount, from brewing potions to summoning spirits, from fording a river to shooting arrows at a giant spider – all actions of a rustic fantasy adventure can be resolved using the same rules and with a single roll, making way for the story you want to tell.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The Action Grimoire is a supplement to the core rules of Legend in the Mist, offering an encyclopedic collection of suggestions for typical player actions and how the game’s rolls and Effects can be used to resolve them. It can be used by players and Narrator's alike for inspiration for actions and Consequences, or as a quick reference on how to resolve specific actions and situations during the game.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="legendinthemist_peddlerscartcollection"&gt;&lt;a id="legendinthemist_peddlerscartcollection"&gt;Legend In The Mist - Peddler's Cart Collection&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/f2fbc9260734b1a9c76ec7583971a42ba447e5ae.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=5da112f4cd869c8518ebab53bcc28432"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;A collection of content released during the Launch Fest for Legend in the Mist, the Peddler's Cart is filled with options for both Heroes and Narrators to use on their next adventure beyond the coziness of rustic fantasy and delving into the other fantasy genres. It was released as a daily drop in the weeks leading up to the release of Legend in the Mist, with each week having its own central theme. Now you can relive the hype and catch up to this exclusive content!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Enjoy 56 new content items for Heroes and Narrators:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;• Character Tropes that embody different fantasy archetypes&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;• Theme Kits, each with its own unique theme specials&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;• Recipes to craft, cook, and prepare&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;• Ways of Magic to explore the limitless potential of the arcane arts&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;• New Challenges for your Heroes to overcome&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;• Journey Vignettes to embark on&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="legendinthemist_characterpack"&gt;&lt;a id="legendinthemist_characterpack"&gt;Legend In The Mist - Character Pack&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/61d038069d655763dc5aef914f54a8ffb07c1cff.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=1e263ab2d26a5fa8a56526637f664805"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Twenty (20) beautifully-illustrated pregen character folios.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The Legend in the Mist Character Pack contains 20 character folios with a graphic summary of the game rules and dice roll outcomes, and suggestions for cool tag combos.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Each character is given in both screen (wide) and printer-friendly formats.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;• "Bumbler" - An incompetent beekeeper and meadery owner, hanging on by sheer luck • Finn, the Red Marshal - A strapping young constable protecting a sleepy village and dreaming of glory • Gerrin The Deerstalker - A spirited woodland huntsman dedicated above all to his family • Gorna and Truffles - A gregarious cook and his porcine pal, out to taste every dish in the Dales • Higgins Two-Shells - A stalwart yet battle-weary bard, in search for peace that would bring back his love • Jayne Tinkerplate - A fledgling sellsword set on changing her stars - and to hell with the naysayers! • Kelvis - A simple farmer and farrier searching for his missing wife and daughter • Koto Pondskimmer - A river-faring fisherman and local brigand, sailing through life without a care • Mistle of Salthill - A morose vagabond, bound to wander among graves and keep the dead asleep • Old Man Carlo - A kindly old cobbler who thought of peaceful retirement until he met a pixie • Rags - A curious puppeteer whose street shows foretell unexpected fates • Rosamund, the Wise One - An aging recluse versed in the Oldways, a sage and apothecary for her dale • Seede, the Apple Picker - A rascally orphan working as a farmhand, pranking the people of Ravenhome • Siondelle the Cairnmaker - A wild-at-heart pilgrim, fleeing a nefarious past life to search for the Unseen • Bogomil - A magician of considerable power plotting a quest that will change the world • Daunt of House Mattina - A gallant mystery knight seeking to uphold the motto of his fallen noble house • Gaelle - A highland hunter who made a pact for a sword that can slay monsters • GlintFallow - A grumpy and greedy creature, remnant of bygone times, looking for a new home • Kinsi - A peculiar peddler in the market for old trinkets, baubles, and heirlooms • Gullencry - A magnificent dragon fascinated by the little lives of human critters&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="legendinthemist_scenemapsandtokens"&gt;&lt;a id="legendinthemist_scenemapsandtokens"&gt;Legend In The Mist - Scene Maps &amp; Tokens&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/5549b3543cd28c3c8b282aba5194cb6c3ab480d8.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=22270194f0d18c764d339f053d169313"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Immerse your players in the world of Hearts of Ravensdale with this collection of Scene Maps &amp;amp; Tokens that serve as the perfect tabletop resource for Legend in the Mist.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This game accessory contains eight (8) beautifully-illustrated scene maps of locations in the world of the Hearts of Ravensdale, and 51 tokens representing Heroes, Characters, and Monsters from the Hearts of Ravensdale: Wake of the Oldways campaign and Legend in the Mist Character Pack.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This set contains the following maps:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;• The Fields • The Folkhearth • The Sunken Tower • The Hermit's Abode • The Ancient Altar • The Palisade • The Barrow • The Woods&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="legendinthemist_thetwilightdeck"&gt;&lt;a id="legendinthemist_thetwilightdeck"&gt;Legend In The Mist - The Twilight Deck&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/3837a0f4b370b7a0d8389a91628a4c8c81d77f03.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=72d0ec283090c4b62192a2c7698d57f0"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;A deck of forty (40) beautifully-illustrated Challenge cards featuring Creatures of Twilight and other adversaries of might, mystery, and magic.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The Twilight Deck contains forty (40) cards describing Challenges for Legend in the Mist, from village threats to strange Creatures of Twilight, including their actions, abilities, ways to overcome them, and secret vulnerabilities. Includes Challenges for the Wake of the Oldways campaign found in the Hearts of Ravensdale setting book.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Each card contains:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;• A narrative side with the Challenge’s art, description, and flavor text or quote • A Challenge profile side with the Challenge’s Limits, Tags and Statuses, Specials, Threats, and Consequences&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The Twilight Deck includes the following Challenges:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;• Adversaries (11) – Azeria, Bombardier, Cold-Hearted Stabber, Craggen Seeker, Curse Eater, Dog Boys, Sadistic Gauler, Stormhelm Knight, Thane Codprice, Thrad Pine-Splitter, Wanderlands Graverobber • Creatures of Twilight (23) – Albino Salamander, Antlered Forest Spirit, Bargaining Devil, Boggart, Dolmen Dirger, Drowning Beauty, Eglerion, Gajowy, Grandfather Crow, Greedy Dragon, Hag of Black Oak, Harvest Hag, Hexia, Mirelings, Poisoned Wurm, Reeling Harvester, Sorrowbalm, The Dolorous Lady, The Green Maiden, The Painted Beast, Twisted Creation, Vila, Waken Sentry • Village Life (6) – Close-Knit Circle, Concerned Villagers, Goat Race, Mrowkin, Pastoral Priestess, Shrine&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="legendinthemist_sounctrack"&gt;&lt;a id="legendinthemist_sounctrack"&gt;Legend In The Mist - Soundtrack&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/af2dee67051f740c5778b278c5ac6e7323183c02.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=cb8dafc457d6cc5ff34fd336e8089e86"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Ten (10) enchanting and haunting tracks to accompany your rustic fantasy journey and/or your playthrough of the Hearts of Ravensdale campaign.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Includes mp3, ogg, wav formats + looping track variants.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;1. Cooking the Sapsauce 2:51 2. Across the Dales 2:47 3. What Cannot Be Restored 2:55 4. Shiverwash Marshes 3:17 5. Song of the Winds 2:56 6. At the Corner of the Eye 2:46 7. Into the Aldenweald 3:01 8. The Painted Beast 2:28 9.The Waning of the Oldways 3:09 10. The Lady of the Dales 3:25&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Music by Ian Fisher - Tabletop RPG Music.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="legendinthemist_narratorsscreen"&gt;&lt;a id="legendinthemist_narratorsscreen"&gt;Legend In The Mist - Narrator's Screen&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/4425089f58f1425cb7c6d03260442772a9929ae1.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=a35974f4e7aad075fa6d5c4f2e78aea6"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;All the rules, tips, and suggestions a Legend In The Mist Narrator needs handy.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Protect your secrets as the Master of Ceremonies in the most evocative manner possible with this gorgeously illustrated Narrator Screen!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This three-panel Narrator Screen is big enough to keep your players from prying into your plans, while providing you with key information, such as summarized rules for combat, notes for exploration and magic, as well as suggestions for Challenges, Threats, and Consequences for any kind of activity.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</description>
