      <description>&lt;div&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/87c33a4db824c629a5d830bfe70ae0a22a7703b5.png?auto=compress,format&amp;h=340&amp;w=1200&amp;s=aa889a2c9b18e7d56d255eb419e91024"&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/995023cdbf782361c11f550a484191728a003f2c.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=crop&amp;h=600&amp;w=1200&amp;s=46465876a679faef13809171d6619ce1"&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Crochet your cares away&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Fill your closet with crochet wearables with this library of craft ebooks from Open Road Media! This collection of crochet patterns and inspiration includes 29 books with ideas for basically everything—from shawls, hats, handbags, and adorable animal slippers to southwest-inspired blankets and cozy cardigans. If you’re intimidated by any of the more complex patterns, there are also plenty of simple projects for beginners you can finish in a few hours! Next time you need some inspiration for an ambitious project or just something to do with your hands in your idle time, let these crochet books be your guide! Get all 29 books for the price of your choice, and support the Breast Cancer Research Foundation with your purchase! &lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#0"&gt;Pay $5 to unlock!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#icantbelieveimcrochetingsocks"&gt;I Cant Believe Im Crocheting Socks&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#crochetshrugsandboleros"&gt;Crochet Shrugs &amp; Boleros&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#slouchybeaniesandheadwraps"&gt;Slouchy Beanies and Headwraps&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#bt18"&gt;Pay $18 or more to also unlock!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#60quickcrochetprojectsforbeginners"&gt;60 Quick Crochet Projects for Beginners&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#crochetsouthwestspirit"&gt;Crochet Southwest Spirit&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#twosimpleshapes26crochetedcardiganstopsandsweaters"&gt;Two Simple Shapes = 26 Crocheted Cardigans, Tops &amp; Sweaters&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#crochetanimalslippers"&gt;Crochet Animal Slippers&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#makeinaweekendshawls"&gt;Make in a Weekend Shawls&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#madhatter"&gt;Mad Hatter&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#crochetinfinityscarves"&gt;Crochet Infinity Scarves&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#colorfulcrochetknitwear"&gt;Colorful Crochet Knitwear&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#hatsandscarves"&gt;Hats &amp; Scarves&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#crochetthecuffedshawlandmore"&gt;Crochet the Cuffed Shawl &amp; More&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#everydayshawls"&gt;Everyday Shawls&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#crochetbarefootsandals"&gt;Crochet Barefoot Sandals&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#curvygirlcrochet"&gt;Curvy Girl Crochet&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#shrugsshawlsandbolerostocrochet"&gt;Shrugs, Shawls &amp; Boleros to Crochet&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#healingshawls"&gt;Healing Shawls&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#musthavehandbags"&gt;Must Have Handbags&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#supersizecrochet"&gt;Supersize Crochet&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#hoodedscarves"&gt;Hooded Scarves&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#crochetscarvesandcowls"&gt;Crochet Scarves &amp; Cowls&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#crochethandcraftedhandbags_book1"&gt;Crochet Handcrafted Handbags Book 1&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#crochethandcraftedhandbags_book2"&gt;Crochet Handcrafted Handbags Book 2&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#crochethandcraftedhandbags_book3"&gt;Crochet Handcrafted Handbags Book 3&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#crochethandcraftedhandbags_book4"&gt;Crochet Handcrafted Handbags Book 4&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#easyessentialbagscrochet"&gt;Easy Essential Bags Crochet&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#pocketshawls"&gt;Pocket Shawls&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#messybunhatsplus"&gt;Messy Bun Hats,Plus!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h2 id="0"&gt;Pay $5 to unlock!&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 id="icantbelieveimcrochetingsocks"&gt;&lt;a id="icantbelieveimcrochetingsocks"&gt;I Cant Believe Im Crocheting Socks&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/885ea76814e148a9c9069195f33b33817069745b.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=e3b09883c0fbf015a6969a28ce67230f"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Short, 4-page guide covers picking the right yarn, creating custom sizing, and crocheting 2 different heel types. Sock project designs include: basic cuff-down, basic toe-up socks, ankle socks, cabled socks, rippled socks and more. Projects call for size 1 super fine and 3 light weight yarns and US size D-3 and E-4 crochet hooks. Beginner to intermediate skill level.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="crochetshrugsandboleros"&gt;&lt;a id="crochetshrugsandboleros"&gt;Crochet Shrugs &amp; Boleros&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/22f88794e10e1cf05bb1ff5972f13c136cd217b6.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=057606b926a6ebf03e849bf255e666cd"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Choose from six fresh styles to crochet with ease, using size 2 light weight to size 5 bulky weight yarns and US size 7, H or J crochet hooks. Three are made in one size fits most women; the others are for small, medium, and large sizes. Designs include: ice storm, bonfire shrug, lilacs in May, summery silk shrug, and more. 2&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="slouchybeaniesandheadwraps"&gt;&lt;a id="slouchybeaniesandheadwraps"&gt;Slouchy Beanies and Headwraps&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/1cdf93c7b8482a4921f6dd96e66c9692ed382dd4.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=93cf9200352769f9b29addb1e8c8b77c"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Designs include: basic beanie, shells beanie, cables beanie, newsboy beanie, lacy headwrap and more. Patterns include adult sizes small/medium and large/extra-large, fitting head circumferences between 19" and 21". Projects can be made using size 4 worsted or 5 bulky weight yarn with crochet hooks in sizes ranging between US H-8 and J-10, or 5 and 6mms. Includes round-by-round instructions for each design. Beginner to easy skill level.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2 id="bt18"&gt;Pay $18 or more to also unlock!&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 id="60quickcrochetprojectsforbeginners"&gt;&lt;a id="60quickcrochetprojectsforbeginners"&gt;60 Quick Crochet Projects for Beginners&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/ea5ad43df37e47131d978699d60c83b7cf8ef1c9.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=4b0faaed80a47a5ead3ae95690b1a09c"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;With a thorough how-to section that includes step-by-step photography and 60 patterns that range in project type and technique, 60 Quick Crochet Projects for Beginners will help new crocheters build skills and make many useful items at the same time.   Whether you're picking up a crochet hook for the first time or are familiar with the basic crochet stitches and need something to make, 60 Quick Crochet Projects for Beginners is the perfect book for you. A thorough learn-to-crochet section instills all the core knowledge you need to get started, and an expansive collection of 60 beginner-friendly patterns provides endless hours of happy crafting. Beginner doesn't have to mean boring, so this pattern collection is accessible yet includes numerous techniques such as colorwork, bobbles, textures, and more to keep crocheters engaged and constantly developing their abilities as they stitch hats, scarves, shawls, mittens, blankets, and even garments. Sidebars are included throughout with tips, tricks, and insight to build crafting knowledge and encourage critical thinking and creativity. With every project made in Pacific from Cascade Yarns, this superwash wool and acrylic blend comes in dozens of colors and will ensure that each project is beautiful, soft, and durable.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="crochetsouthwestspirit"&gt;&lt;a id="crochetsouthwestspirit"&gt;Crochet Southwest Spirit&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/709abd5496639532f46b7aa0ded0db8037b8d7c1.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=f46e23fd9434db300d1dd87099446b96"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;An exquisite collection of beautiful boho crochet projects that bring the style of the American Southwest into your home.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;i&gt;Crochet Southwest Spirit&lt;/i&gt; offers laid-back bohemian style inspired by natural landscapes that's a breath of fresh air for your crochet repertoire. You'll feel the freedom of the wide-open spaces and deep turquoise skies of the American Southwest as you work this unique collection of patterns.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Peaceful color palettes drawn from the mountains, mesas, valleys, deserts, rivers, and rock formations of Colorado, New Mexico, Utah, and Arizona bring a relaxed vibe to these beginner and intermediate patterns. Author Susan Kennedy of Pretty Peaceful Crochet is blessed by beautiful geography, living in the gorgeous San Juan Mountains of southwest Colorado near Durango. She loves to make boho home décor inspired by the nature around her that is as practical and durable as it is beautiful. You'll find blankets, pillows, rugs, baskets, towels, wall hangings, wraps, and tote bags in this collection. Here, simple serape-style stripes are right at home next to intricate Southwestern tapestry crochet patterns.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Susan's love of math and geometry inspires her to make complex patterns as simple as possible to stitch. Patterns don't have to be complicated to be beautiful. &lt;i&gt;Crochet Southwest Spirit &lt;/i&gt;makes the most of the meditative repetition and soothing rhythm of crochet for maximum crochet enjoyment and satisfaction. Many of the projects are perfect to crochet while unwinding over a weekend.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The author holds the fiber arts traditions carried on by generations of Southern Ute, Ute Mountain, Diné Navajo, and Hopi families in the Four Corners area of the USA in great respect. The original projects in this book use natural cotton and wool fibers produced by indigenous artists and shepherds whenever possible to honor this history and promote a sustainable future for this land.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="twosimpleshapes26crochetedcardiganstopsandsweaters"&gt;&lt;a id="twosimpleshapes26crochetedcardiganstopsandsweaters"&gt;Two Simple Shapes = 26 Crocheted Cardigans, Tops &amp; Sweaters&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/b99f1974c5ac3add0e630a9413ee963528cb8029.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=661bb2e24ff3ddb50a247bfb2848e275"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;“These easy-to-follow instructions will have you hooking up a whole new wardrobe of beautiful, creative crochet pieces you will be proud to wear.” —WeCrochet magazine   Making crochet tops has never been so easy! Crocheted squares and rectangles can be shaped and combined to form a surprising array of pullovers, cardigans, lightweight tops, and wraps. Simple instructions will have you creating a variety of gorgeous crochet apparel. Most designs are beginner or intermediate level and build upon your knowledge of basic stitches to create textural styles that look more complex than they are. Crochet two squares to make the Diamond Crop Top, an on-trend lacy look you can whip up quickly, or crochet a rectangle, fold, and add sleeves to make the Goldenrod Cardigan, a squishy, comfy wrap to wear all year. Sumptuous yarns in gorgeous colors from Lion Brand’s vast selection of yarns were chosen for the pattern samples shown in this book, assuring that all of the yarns used are easy-to-find, affordable options. Crochet in the colors shown, or try your own color scheme. Lion Brand yarns have a large selection of colors from which to choose, so enjoy the yarn aisle!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="crochetanimalslippers"&gt;&lt;a id="crochetanimalslippers"&gt;Crochet Animal Slippers&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/bdc092effc53abb26fafc9a5775d93abef4b42a5.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=e0f6d4624632a1fd8b60270162e918c1"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Create animal slippers for the whole family, with this cute collection of patterns from leading crochet designer Ira Rott. First choose your slipper type ; slide, shoe or boot ; then choose your size, and finally choose one of 20 different animal designs.&lt;/b&gt;      This adorable book will have you reaching for your hook and crocheting the most appropriate animals for your tribe. Why not try the elephants for grandpa (who sometimes forgets), the pandas for mum (whose mascara always runs) and the bears for the little one who loves warm hugs... there are options to delight them all and keep you in handmade gifts to give for years!        Ira Rott is well known for her gorgeous animal designs and her easy-to-follow crochet patterns, which include step-by-step photographs for any fiddly parts, and crochet charts alongside the written patterns. She expertly guides you through making three different kinds of crochet slippers ; shoes with covered heels, boots with ankle cuffs, and slides which are backless slippers.        Knowing what size to make is made easy thanks to a clever measuring chart at the front of the book. Simply open the flap, put your foot on the measuring gauge and instantly see what size you need. In the book are useful tables that show how much yarn and what size hook you will need for each size. Complete step-by-step instructions and charts then show you how to master each slipper type, with templates for adding non-slip soles to your crochet slippers too.        Once you've mastered the slipper-making, the fun begins in creating your crochet animal designs. Choose from: the Snuggly Pug, the Cuddly Bear, the Happy Penguin, the Zingy Dinosaur, the Starry Unicorn, the Rock 'n' Roll Panda, the Sleepy Koala, the Mossy Sloth. the Graceful Elephant, the Playful Pig, the Mischievous Raccoon, the Cheeky Monkey, the Woolly Sheep, the Sandy Turtle, the Sassy Cat, the Hippie Llama, the Brave Moose, the Artful Fox, the Friendly Cow and the Roaring Lion. But that's not all ; Ira also shows you how you can mix and match patterns to create all sorts of new animals too. Add the unicorn horn to the cat for a cute uni-kitty, and mix the dinosaur and the penguin to create a wise owl ; once you've discovered that you can customize your crochet slippers you'll be able to create unlimited options!&lt;h3 id="makeinaweekendshawls"&gt;&lt;a id="makeinaweekendshawls"&gt;Make in a Weekend Shawls&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/2a8fb07fd389579040d9aa2cd629a72f33708169.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=1ea998cc46e5cb284d0a6a009e9669b4"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;12 design include styles for all ages. Projects include: shell sensation shawl, quick and colorful, crosses and diamonds, the primrose wrap, a heart in her pocket and more. Projects can be made using US size 4 medium or 5 bulky weight yarns and crochet hooks ranging from a size G-6, 4 millimeters, to K-10.5, 6.5 millimeters. Includes step-by-step instructions for each project and advanced stitches. Shawls feature a variety of cluster, shell, V and treble crochet stitches. Finished project sizes range from toddler size 2T to a 64"x 58" adult wrap. Easy to intermediate skill level.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="madhatter"&gt;&lt;a id="madhatter"&gt;Mad Hatter&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/80105dd72e6007fe653f78e0d37f786bc1516957.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=37397c1440ce4981b087a1db2837332a"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;In &lt;i&gt;Mad Hatter&lt;/i&gt;, Crochet artist and founder of the brand Knotted Neon, Aynsley Grealis presents a pattern collection for making fanciful hats, balaclavas, and handbags in all shapes and sizes.&lt;/b&gt;     Artist Aynsley Grealis is the creator of the popular Instagram @KnottedNeon, and her fanciful balaclavas, handbags, sweaters, and bucket hats are sensations that attract eager buyers (who pay one hundred dollars—and up—for each custom piece) and a growing audience of crocheters seeking to replicate these brilliant patterns.     In &lt;i&gt;Mad Hatter&lt;/i&gt;, her first book, Grealis shares her designs and patterns (unpublished until now) to teach readers how to make three simple bases (a balaclava, a pull-on hat, and a handbag) and then how to decorate each by incorporating layers of whimsical appliques. The patterns look complicated, but crochet with ease—the secret is in the embellishments: Patterns for crocheted flowers, bees, stars, clouds, an entire coral reef of fish and sea creatures, and a field of mushrooms, veggies, and exotic greenery, are included, enabling readers to hook wonderful hats and bags with lots of flair (or just a little!).     Grealis’s approach inspires crocheters to innovate and playfully reinvent by using her easy-to-follow instructions as a springboard. Suitable for beginners and adaptable to all skill levels, these fun and fabulous designs open a world of imagination to readers.    &lt;b&gt;Includes Color Illustrations&lt;/b&gt;&lt;h3 id="crochetinfinityscarves"&gt;&lt;a id="crochetinfinityscarves"&gt;Crochet Infinity Scarves&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/b69f6b4aec5d3b6283e4515d10f45b643e851a87.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=5107c4746786425bba8a2e16ace65fe1"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Make these trendy accessories to add to your winter wardrobe!&lt;/b&gt;     Crochet yourself a one-off infinity scarf with this collection of eight new and individual patterns. Choose from a selection ranging from a delicate, lacy crochet scarf to a unique design inspired by the traditional granny square. Or why not try the Perfectly Plaid infinity scarf inspired by recent catwalk collections?     Whether you are looking for the latest crochet ideas, a pattern for a trendy mobius scarf, or a contemporary take on a crochet classic, you will find it in this collection. All the scarves are perfect teamed with jeans and a sweater or paired with a winter coat for a walk in the country or the commute to work—and all the crochet techniques you need to get started are included.&lt;h3 id="colorfulcrochetknitwear"&gt;&lt;a id="colorfulcrochetknitwear"&gt;Colorful Crochet Knitwear&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/ee232d616c1eef591efdaea30fbc991297c7720e.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=c20ade1dd815d88304420344f25a4c9b"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Crochet bright and beautiful clothes and accessories with this guide to the most exciting colorwork techniques like intarsia, mosaic, and tapestry crochet.If you love colorful knitwear, this guide to crochet colorwork techniques will set you on your war to creating your own unique crocheted wardrobe. Author Sandra Gutierrez, creator of Nomad Stitches, explains the key crochet colorwork techniques she uses in her designs: tapestry crochet, mosaic crochet, intarsia crochet and stripes, with step-by-step instructions and photography. There is a wide range of garments and accessories from sweaters to tanks to cardigans and wraps, and all the clothes are graded to a range of sizes, ranging from a size thirty-two-inch bust up to a sixty-four-inch bust.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="hatsandscarves"&gt;&lt;a id="hatsandscarves"&gt;Hats &amp; Scarves&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/a380f75c017ca94f3b04594952c8f23446ffd6d9.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=de0287b578d81d223c85b170ea01fd7a"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;These 14 scarves, hats, and cowls to crochet with various weights of yarn are fashionable accents, perfect for any wardrobe. Designs include: quick scarf, soft ruffly scarf, multicolored set, and more. Includes row-by-row instructions for each project. Hat sizing is based on a 20" to 22" head circumference but can easily be adjusted by adding or removing stitches. Finished scarves range in size from 3 1/2"x 65" and 9"x 80 1/2". Easy and intermediate skill level.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="crochetthecuffedshawlandmore"&gt;&lt;a id="crochetthecuffedshawlandmore"&gt;Crochet the Cuffed Shawl &amp; More&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/9f20a900e694ed3c90b764f65d9a965b4ea138e9.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=5ab9366da456516ef67f8b14b76528cc"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Designs include: poncho, hybrid scarf, and more. All are easy skill level. Work up with size 4 medium weight or size 5 bulky weight yarn.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="everydayshawls"&gt;&lt;a id="everydayshawls"&gt;Everyday Shawls&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/7585e7d3d46fa67f0bc2a85ad19c54844dcf0764.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=5e46730f515ad8c64261718b9f8062fd"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;These 9 designs are all simple to crochet and can accompany any style, outfit, or personality. Designs include: caress, vivacious, prestige, refreshing, and more. Each features its own unique stitch pattern with a variety or textured borders. Projects can be made using US size 4 worsted weight yarn and a variety of crochet hook sizes including: I-9, 5.5 millimeters, J-10, 6 millimeters and K-10.5, 6.5 millimeters. Finished shawl sizes measure between approximately 18"x 86" and 65"x 29". Skill level ratings range from Easy to Easy+.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="crochetbarefootsandals"&gt;&lt;a id="crochetbarefootsandals"&gt;Crochet Barefoot Sandals&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/160491d7bdb3609a3094ea565cf720fb59e63414.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=731aefcf0af07162c35d9de0804e4939"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Crochet the perfect addition to your summer wardrobe with this fully illustrated guide to making your own barefoot sandals.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;Perfect for summer beach weddings, garden parties, outdoor festivals or just longing by the pool, barefoot sandals are all the rage—and now this fun fashion trend can be your next crochet project.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;Crochet Barefoot Sandals&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;features eight cute and crafty designs, including a fish motif with glass beads on the ties, asymmetric ivory stars, a bright mandala pattern, and more!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;Crocheted sandals are an ideal summer craft project, and these quick and easy patterns are perfect for crocheters of all skill levels. This collection features designs by four different pattern designers including crochet blogger and author Sarah Shrimpton.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;h3 id="curvygirlcrochet"&gt;&lt;a id="curvygirlcrochet"&gt;Curvy Girl Crochet&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/ecc1aaa2f62bd76399a1164c71c1f5162d2b9c03.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=1fda07bc448f44b334a2d749d91cac96"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Celebrate your curves with crochet patterns designed to fit beautifully and flatter confidently.&lt;/b&gt;   Say goodbye to resizing standard patterns and hello to garments made just for you. &lt;i&gt;Curvy Girl Crochet&lt;/i&gt; offers 25 stylish, plus-size patterns that embrace full-figured fashion with flair. From cozy pullovers and elegant wraps to everyday wardrobe staples, each design is crafted with real bodies in mind—no guesswork, no compromises.   Expert designer Mary Beth Temple guides you through each project with clear instructions, helpful schematics, and smart techniques for achieving the perfect fit. Whether you're new to crochet or a seasoned stitcher, you'll find inspiration and empowerment in every pattern.   This is more than a pattern book—it's a celebration of style, skill, and self-expression for curvy crocheters everywhere. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="shrugsshawlsandbolerostocrochet"&gt;&lt;a id="shrugsshawlsandbolerostocrochet"&gt;Shrugs, Shawls &amp; Boleros to Crochet&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/f6101920a8786875af31f1bf74b5b2687e40eccc.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=dc7f16848d133b49e706ee73cf895d5c"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;6 different trend-setting designs will be the perfect addition to your wardrobe. Designs include: chevron lace shawl, convertible flower lace shawl, rosy tweed bolero, and more. Projects call for size 4 worsted weight yarn and crochet hooks in US sizes I-9 and J-10. Some designs include multiple sizing options, but most are written as one-size-fits-most. Includes step-by-step crochet instructions and piecing diagrams for each design. Easy to intermediate skill level.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="healingshawls"&gt;&lt;a id="healingshawls"&gt;Healing Shawls&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/be87a866ab1a049c3a4d343b72d111247d3fa2d3.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=c8b9b47e9c809649057943c844a948b5"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;15 crochet patterns for making these meaningful gifts. Designs include: simple shells shawl, gentle waves shawl, triangle shawl, and more.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="musthavehandbags"&gt;&lt;a id="musthavehandbags"&gt;Must Have Handbags&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/63b9ae1dfad7c2934606a46a9cf38188020ffd1c.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=9e9775c4609badbbb64f4239ad59be56"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;The 6 crochet designs in this book include step-by-step instructions and full-color photos to bring your vision to light. All made at an easy skill level, you'll have a custom handbag before you know it. Designs include: barrel purse, bucket style tote, swirl handbag, and more.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="supersizecrochet"&gt;&lt;a id="supersizecrochet"&gt;Supersize Crochet&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/c9c848df785928d2d7bb41963b758c1c87861790.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=89d7db48c3cfed820487038a93dd264e"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Go big &lt;i&gt;and&lt;/i&gt; go home—with twenty extreme crochet patterns for home décor and accessories by the crochet designer and author of &lt;i&gt;Modern Crochet Bible&lt;/i&gt;.&lt;/b&gt;   In her previous book, &lt;i&gt;Extreme Crochet with Chunky Yarn&lt;/i&gt;, crochet pattern writer Sarah Shrimpton introduced crafters to the joy of turning chunky yarn into funky fashion accessories and fun home decorations. Now she’s back with an even bigger collection of extreme crochet projects.   Perfect for crocheters of all skill levels, &lt;i&gt;Supersize Crochet&lt;/i&gt; covers everything you need to get started, including tips on working with a range of bigger hooks, plus step-by-step instructions for making everything from super-sized bags and beanies to blankets, cushions, plant holders, and more.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="hoodedscarves"&gt;&lt;a id="hoodedscarves"&gt;Hooded Scarves&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/574ff3775609a92e4438db9ff9a7e22e1eb15189.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=ad2b84332da6d714f205c74a98c09850"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Go casual or super feminine, you decide. Designs include: dramatic stripes, warm and woodsy, blue shells, Gaelic charm, and more. Projects call for size 4 worsted weight yarn and a variety of crochet hooks ranging from US sizes H-8 and K-10 1/2. Includes step-by-step instructions for each design and a general guide to crochet. Finished sizing fits most adults. Beginner skill level.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="crochetscarvesandcowls"&gt;&lt;a id="crochetscarvesandcowls"&gt;Crochet Scarves &amp; Cowls&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/d70d4d3423bbe304917dc79b2fee5e648b982ddc.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=1ca887cb82aa451cd17fa726996472d4"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;With this collection, you can follow the patterns or use the included size charts to customize the widths and lengths of each project. Complete instructions are provided for making 12 different designs: Mary, Anna, Bessie, Maria, Martha and more. Each design features its own unique texture and shape, from ripples to granny inspired clusters. Creating a scarf or cowl that is exactly what you want has never been easier. Projects call for size 1 super fine, 4 medium, and 5 bulky weight yarns, and crochet hooks in US sizes ranging between E and K. Easy skill level.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="crochethandcraftedhandbags_book1"&gt;&lt;a id="crochethandcraftedhandbags_book1"&gt;Crochet Handcrafted Handbags Book 1&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/6eb96a1662adee726be6ac53821c6b2881a0cfe3.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=77be584f81d9d411a9a27f442cbd1634"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;This beginner friendly crochet book includes a 31 page guide to purse making basics and 3 project patterns that can be made using simple crochet techniques. Purse-making guide covers: swatching, tools, yarn types, weaving ends, blocking, joining stitches, interfacing, lining, creating handles, attaching hardware and closures, special techniques and more. Projects include: convertible clutch, granny square bag and burgundy bag with leather base. Designs can be made using US size 4 worsted and 6 super bulky weight yarns and crochet hooks in sizes I-9, 5.5 millimeters, and M/N, 9 millimeters. Finished bags measure between 9"x 7"x 1" and 12"x 11"x 4 1/2". Basic skill level.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="crochethandcraftedhandbags_book2"&gt;&lt;a id="crochethandcraftedhandbags_book2"&gt;Crochet Handcrafted Handbags Book 2&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/93d3a4cd3b3acb5fa30a1bb3990f881ccf66c31e.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=c1e9c92ac81344de0a1b9e403ab6158d"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;This easy crochet book includes a 31 page guide to purse making basics and 5 project patterns that can be made using simple crochet techniques. Purse-making guide covers: swatching, tools, yarn types, weaving ends, blocking, joining stitches, interfacing, lining, creating handles, attaching hardware and closures, special techniques and more. Projects include: wristlet with buckle, saddle bag, messenger bag, Tunisian handbag and vintage handbag. Designs can be made using US size 1 super fine, 3 light and 5 bulky weight yarns and crochet hooks in sizes J-10, 6 millimeters, and K-10 1/2, 6.5 millimeters. Finished bags measure between 8"x 4" and 15"x 11"x 4". Easy skill level.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="crochethandcraftedhandbags_book3"&gt;&lt;a id="crochethandcraftedhandbags_book3"&gt;Crochet Handcrafted Handbags Book 3&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/82e3b9a47431c4f1c4789efa65e898c08b92c2f7.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=de146f68d1996f1fd2dba37853bd2877"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;This intermediate crochet book includes a 31 page guide to purse making basics and 7 project patterns. Purse-making guide covers: swatching, tools, yarn types, weaving ends, blocking, joining stitches, interfacing, lining, creating handles, attaching hardware and closures, special techniques and more. Projects include: diamond coin purse, double zipper travel bag, puff stitch clutch, tote with zipper pockets, grommet bag, tapestry drawstring backpack and Arabel cabled tote. Designs can be made using US size 2 fine, 3 light and 4 worsted weight yarns and crochet hooks in sizes H-8, 5 millimeters, and I-9, 5.35 millimeters. Finished bags measure between 5 1/2"x 4"x 1" and 12"x 9"x 3". Intermediate skill level.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="crochethandcraftedhandbags_book4"&gt;&lt;a id="crochethandcraftedhandbags_book4"&gt;Crochet Handcrafted Handbags Book 4&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/2b844513f0bf90399b3794714f0bacdd85d6c2b9.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=3bf35af964051783ae528dda1685f081"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;This advanced crochet book includes a 31 page guide to purse making basics and 4 project patterns that can be made using decorative crochet stitches. Purse-making guide covers: swatching, tools, yarn types, weaving ends, blocking, joining stitches, interfacing, lining, creating handles, attaching hardware and closures, special techniques and more. Projects include: plaid doctor bag, cabled handbag, barrel bag and houndstooth bowler bag. Designs can be made using US size 4 worsted and 5 bulky weight yarns and crochet hooks in sizes H-8, 5 millimeters, and I-9, 5.35 millimeters. Finished bags measure between 12"x 9"x 4 1/2" and 14"x 10"x 6". Advanced skill level.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="easyessentialbagscrochet"&gt;&lt;a id="easyessentialbagscrochet"&gt;Easy Essential Bags Crochet&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/5c84c800e50295cf14008468277ed4cad9d11c58.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=5bb86e50614c8cba821b3c1c22dfe03b"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;This collection has easy crochet styles in lots of sizes and shapes. You'll want them all. No matter your style, purpose, or skill level, there is a bag design for you in this book. Designs include: big carry-all, messenger bag, li'l market bag, medallion bag, and more.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="pocketshawls"&gt;&lt;a id="pocketshawls"&gt;Pocket Shawls&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/fda05f251f305f0154e167691e6578f63cca2660.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=e561bb6b56419a1afd81eb67489aba8f"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Each design features pockets perfect for keeping your cell phone or other small items handy. Designs include: coastal tide, perky patches, coastal tide, perky patches, granny pockets, hooded comfy, button-flap pockets, desert stars, starry night and more. Each shawl can be made using size 4 worsted weight yarn and a crochet hook in size US size H-8, I-9 or J-10. Includes step-by-step instructions and a guide to crochet stitches. Each design includes single size options for children and adults, with two bonus doll sized designs. Children sizes measure between approximately 11 1/2"x 29" and 12 1/2"x 55". Adult sizes measure between approximately 11 1/2"x 29" and 12 1/2"x 75". Bonus doll sized shawls measure 3"x 17 1/2" and 3"x 7.5". Easy to Intermediate skill level.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="messybunhatsplus"&gt;&lt;a id="messybunhatsplus"&gt;Messy Bun Hats,Plus!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/4e96b1206a372e1ef69b939517506c23846616dc.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=3a93fd4eeac98c8825d35c1acaca1072"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;These easy-to-crochet messy bun hats, headwraps, and roomy slouch hats are all great to wear with today's trendy hairdos. Designs include: lacy bun hat, wide headwrap, slouchy hat, two-tone bun hat, and more. All designs are listed as easy skill level.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</description>
