      <description>&lt;div&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/b1066504ac47d842696a3a366434fad5c1921068.png?auto=compress,format&amp;h=340&amp;w=1200&amp;s=638fc18874a4a0a657cc56aca871ff2f"&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/f3029623940641acc1dd40b8756ba453d48e797c.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=crop&amp;h=600&amp;w=1200&amp;s=7b5f818407512c14a4d608ae40d29e0c"&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Make AI work for you&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Be on the cutting edge of the new technological frontier with this bundle of instructional ebooks and training manuals all about generative and agentic AI! Learn how to scale genAI models with Kubernetes and LangChain, discover practical real-world approaches to using agentic AI and autonomous systems, and find out how to build them yourself to suit your needs! Learn how AI works from the inside so you can use it to optimize just about everything. Pay what you want for this bundle of 17 ebooks about everything AI, and support regenerative agriculture charity Kiss the Ground with your purchase!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#0"&gt;Pay $5 to unlock!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#generativeaiessentials"&gt;Generative AI Essentials&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#riseofgenerativeaiandchatgpt"&gt;Rise of Generative AI and ChatGPT&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#generativeaiforeveryone"&gt;Generative AI for Everyone&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#bt15"&gt;Pay $15 or more to also unlock!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#learnpythongenerativeai"&gt;Learn Python Generative AI&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#buildinggenerativeaiapplicationswithopen-sourcelibraries"&gt;Building Generative AI Applications with Open-source Libraries&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#pythonsimplifiedwithgenerativeai"&gt;Python Simplified with Generative AI&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#buildingintelligentapplicationswithgenerativeai"&gt;Building Intelligent Applications with Generative AI&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#bt18"&gt;Pay $18 or more to also unlock!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#generativeaiwithkubernetes"&gt;Generative AI with Kubernetes&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#practicalapproachtoagenticai"&gt;Practical Approach to Agentic AI&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#hyperautomationwithgenerativeai"&gt;Hyperautomation with Generative AI&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#generativeaiforfinancialservices"&gt;Generative AI for Financial Services&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#agenticaiunleashed"&gt;Agentic AI Unleashed&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#potentialofgenerativeai"&gt;The Potential of Generative AI&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#enterpriseguideforimplementinggenerativeaiandagenticai_bpb"&gt;Generative AI for Enterprises&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#generativeaiwithlangchain_bpb"&gt;Generative AI with LangChain&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#buildingmultimodalgenerativeaiandagenticapplications"&gt;Building Multimodal Generative AI and Agentic Applications&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#generativeaiforhealthcare"&gt;Generative AI for Healthcare&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h2 id="0"&gt;Pay $5 to unlock!&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 id="generativeaiessentials"&gt;&lt;a id="generativeaiessentials" href="https://cdn.humble.com/humblebundle/ops/pdfs/generativeaiessentials_preview.pdf?t=st=1791690397~exp=1791776797~hmac=b0b078526e29205e8f98628cb9494a0aa22a50ac7c72e4bff756222e5511787b"&gt;Generative AI Essentials&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/3aad5c1d148fcc99d403d067f5c15a7eb40c161a.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=437549fdfe7725586087344d29cc6180"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Key Features&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Foundational pathway from ML and deep learning to GANs, VAEs, Transformers, and GPT models&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Creative application focus on image synthesis, style transfer, text generation, and projects&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Cloud and ethics coverage linking AWS, Azure, GCP, bias awareness, and responsible AI design&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Who this book is for&lt;/h4&gt;Data scientists, machine learning engineers, software developers, cloud professionals, educators, students, and creative professionals will benefit most from this foundation in generative AI concepts and applications.&lt;h3 id="riseofgenerativeaiandchatgpt"&gt;&lt;a id="riseofgenerativeaiandchatgpt" href="https://cdn.humble.com/humblebundle/ops/pdfs/riseofgenerativeaiandchatgpt_preview.pdf?t=st=1791690397~exp=1791776797~hmac=e5f0e8f803e70680eb51b265115b20fe41eab8275c972e2286b9de489bcfd0da"&gt;Rise of Generative AI and ChatGPT&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/5d7347bf014afab4b12a716d98868c2768181e13.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=68ea1eb118d378bc16083fbab7319e4f"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Key Features&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt; End-to-end coverage of Generative AI concepts, technologies, and enterprise adoption&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Balanced perspective combining technical depth, governance, ethics, and market insights&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Real-world examples demonstrating AI implementation across diverse business sectors&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Who this book is for&lt;/h4&gt; This book is designed for business professionals, technology leaders, developers, researchers, educators, students, and digital transformation practitioners seeking a practical understanding of Generative AI and ChatGPT. Basic computer literacy is sufficient, while prior programming knowledge is helpful but not essential for following the technical concepts.&lt;h3 id="generativeaiforeveryone"&gt;&lt;a id="generativeaiforeveryone" href="https://cdn.humble.com/humblebundle/ops/pdfs/generativeaiforeveryone_preview.pdf?t=st=1791690397~exp=1791776797~hmac=63efa49cb4ebf5c0e97ce9e387e0c497ae9c29e789c2534bf0034900419b8de6"&gt;Generative AI for Everyone&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/bbf01105c2d62a5c27c2e6af60870b7134402d1c.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=19724a76ff188c28b6c3848e979c72d7"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Key Features&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Beginner-friendly pathway from AI basics to deep learning, CNNs, GANs, diffusion, and LLMs&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Creative and practical use cases covering image generation, search, summarization, and Q&amp;amp;A&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Prototype-led coverage of Document Q&amp;amp;A bots, research assistants, prompt play, and RAG flows&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Who this book is for&lt;/h4&gt;Curious learners, business professionals, students, artists, and technology enthusiasts will benefit most. Prior technical expertise is not required, making the material suitable for readers who want a clear, accessible path into generative AI concepts and applications.&lt;h2 id="bt15"&gt;Pay $15 or more to also unlock!&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 id="learnpythongenerativeai"&gt;&lt;a id="learnpythongenerativeai" href="https://cdn.humble.com/humblebundle/ops/pdfs/learnpythongenerativeai_preview.pdf?t=st=1791690397~exp=1791776797~hmac=09cf6ee341c0d2c0a6aeb5f0f929bda5925cbf624169fb5d900d753b2d117d8d"&gt;Learn Python Generative AI&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/22cde121b55b09cb6db5798ff6fb1441a8f4e437.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=18349cbd96cb80185f9df7c3b2f583c6"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Key Features&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Model coverage spanning GANs, VAEs, TransVAE, Swin Transformer, LLMs, and embeddings concepts&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Industry examples for healthcare, retail, and finance show generative AI business impact today&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Practical project thread connecting image search, vector databases, and model implementation&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Who this book is for&lt;/h4&gt;Current and aspiring AI and deep learning professionals, architects, students, and learners pursuing a career in generative AI will benefit most. Readers should be comfortable learning technical model concepts and applying them to practical implementations, including image search and industry use cases.&lt;h3 id="buildinggenerativeaiapplicationswithopen-sourcelibraries"&gt;&lt;a id="buildinggenerativeaiapplicationswithopen-sourcelibraries" href="https://cdn.humble.com/humblebundle/ops/pdfs/buildinggenerativeaiapplicationswithopen-sourcelibraries_preview.pdf?t=st=1791690397~exp=1791776797~hmac=9f253601d4b7f52d4e9521df254a2a56dee367f96bdf79b7c3fa04bdd4411831"&gt;Building Generative AI Applications with Open-source Libraries&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/e9fb72744dbe0addc94d55314b1bc157ad847dc7.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=1a647b9754e7ea31463721aca5ee4c8e"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Key Features&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Open-source implementation path using LangChain, Llama, Falcon, Hugging Face, and RAG tools&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Retrieval focus covering embeddings, vector databases, information access, and model workflows&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Deployment guidance connecting scalable cloud applications with privacy and ethical practices&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Who this book is for&lt;/h4&gt;Aspiring technology professionals, students, and creative learners who want to build generative AI applications will benefit most. Basic programming knowledge and an interest in AI are helpful, but prior GenAI expertise is not required.&lt;h3 id="pythonsimplifiedwithgenerativeai"&gt;&lt;a id="pythonsimplifiedwithgenerativeai" href="https://cdn.humble.com/humblebundle/ops/pdfs/pythonsimplifiedwithgenerativeai_preview.pdf?t=st=1791690397~exp=1791776797~hmac=1c8aff6cc0dbb33170422f9e8daf56caea715b89bb1785b609478087c437e085"&gt;Python Simplified with Generative AI&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/997092501e96c2902a41d0cb066b47054626ed77.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=69988f0e0129a8cf17535901aefeddc5"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Key Features&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Project-based Python path using GPT-4, Gemini, Copilot, Jupyter Notebooks, and Colab tools&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Data science bridge covering Pandas, sorting algorithms, Fast.ai, CNNs, and practical notebooks&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Deployment focus with Hugging Face, Gradio, web interfaces, responsible AI, and career context&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Who this book is for&lt;/h4&gt;Professionals, aspiring programmers, students, and data analysts interested in learning Python with GenAI tools will benefit most, especially readers seeking practical coding, data science, and AI deployment skills.&lt;h3 id="buildingintelligentapplicationswithgenerativeai"&gt;&lt;a id="buildingintelligentapplicationswithgenerativeai" href="https://cdn.humble.com/humblebundle/ops/pdfs/buildingintelligentapplicationswithgenerativeai_preview.pdf?t=st=1791690397~exp=1791776797~hmac=44f13f03a4ebdbdc0621e3ff1eec91edee9f2295f9944d9d6232cfc7a8f457f1"&gt;Building Intelligent Applications with Generative AI&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/8ceefa71fb730af32a81353564102f57a89af4e8.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=a6d54151a464f8e7700a3b5ce3fdb676"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Key Features&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Application scope spanning text generation, chat agents, creative media, and code completion&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Tool coverage for ChatGPT API, LangChain, Gemini Pro, Streamlit, LangSmith, and FlowiseAI tools&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Responsible AI focus with prompt engineering, data preparation, ethics, and best practices&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Who this book is for&lt;/h4&gt;Developers, data scientists, AI practitioners, and technology enthusiasts will benefit most, especially those interested in using generative AI techniques to build intelligent applications across domains.&lt;h2 id="bt18"&gt;Pay $18 or more to also unlock!&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 id="generativeaiwithkubernetes"&gt;&lt;a id="generativeaiwithkubernetes" href="https://cdn.humble.com/humblebundle/ops/pdfs/generativeaiwithkubernetes_preview.pdf?t=st=1791690397~exp=1791776797~hmac=2158cea84a7913bad057142b0d078d9ce0cf94d2f918be8712efd089dec5d12f"&gt;Generative AI with Kubernetes&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/adc9e3de6efa687c7d228ce06d52883fc99401d6.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=8d352f12358da5c194f3a41210446836"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Key Features&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Kubernetes-native guidance for GPU scheduling, resource management, and model serving patterns&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;MLOps coverage connecting Kubeflow, MLflow, vector databases, RAG, Prometheus, and Grafana&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Production focus on secure, observable, reliable AI infrastructure for modern software teams&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Who this book is for&lt;/h4&gt;Software teams, application developers, product teams, shared services groups, infrastructure engineers, platform teams, and cybersecurity teams will benefit most, especially those preparing generative AI applications for production.&lt;h3 id="practicalapproachtoagenticai"&gt;&lt;a id="practicalapproachtoagenticai" href="https://cdn.humble.com/humblebundle/ops/pdfs/practicalapproachtoagenticai_preview.pdf?t=st=1791690397~exp=1791776797~hmac=2ccbaa0393d2b3c4697df3e63b38b0616050a897accb897391f60a02fba3c238"&gt;Practical Approach to Agentic AI&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/7f14627fea255bacaa800a524559300231a07819.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=cd5d5441202338e88ed97a84e5ef8697"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Key Features&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Agentic AI foundation coverage of autonomy, memory, personas, lifecycle management, and LLMs&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Framework comparison across AutoGen, CrewAI, LangGraph, AgentOps, and agent deployment planning&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Enterprise use cases in finance, healthcare, fraud detection, personalization, and supply chain&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Who this book is for&lt;/h4&gt;Technology leaders, architects, developers, product teams, and AI practitioners with a solid foundation in Python and basic AI concepts will benefit most, especially those designing, scaling, or responsibly deploying autonomous multi-agent systems.&lt;h3 id="hyperautomationwithgenerativeai"&gt;&lt;a id="hyperautomationwithgenerativeai" href="https://cdn.humble.com/humblebundle/ops/pdfs/hyperautomationwithgenerativeai_preview.pdf?t=st=1791690397~exp=1791776797~hmac=b6a52ddfb1dad55ebd4ac20e9f4d3868b6171f125ecc0c47b2cd9da5fa8d5c6a"&gt;Hyperautomation with Generative AI&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/c6ebb1b408b85f03516682da81736241b1f27ff9.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=6f7ff89a4525f2576d91198ac8eace28"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Key Features&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Clear coverage of hyperautomation foundations, RPA platforms, AI components, and GenAI fit&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Business-focused use cases showing where automation improves efficiency and satisfaction levels&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Implementation guidance for talent, infrastructure, scaling, and organization readiness plans&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Who this book is for&lt;/h4&gt;Business leaders and professionals focused on automation, generative AI, and digital transformation will benefit most, including CxOs, consultants, technical architects, enterprise architects, AI engineers, RPA engineers, and automation engineers. Familiarity with business processes, AI, or RPA concepts is helpful but not required.&lt;h3 id="generativeaiforfinancialservices"&gt;&lt;a id="generativeaiforfinancialservices" href="https://cdn.humble.com/humblebundle/ops/pdfs/generativeaiforfinancialservices_preview.pdf?t=st=1791690397~exp=1791776797~hmac=434bc4d0e5c7b8cefc6ff3e2cead88d4068a3271293028a3b34dddce4156e993"&gt;Generative AI for Financial Services&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/4fda39ca1377218fc8935ef6ffd34e4891763c2a.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=0393bcc9775dd73f3d0114a7ed0d8858"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Key Features&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Financial-services focus on ESG analysis, contact centers, customer experience, and use cases&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Trustworthy AI coverage linking model bias, fairness, accountability, ethics, and compliance&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Operations guidance for MLOps, FMOps, deployment management, and production scaling in finance&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Who this book is for&lt;/h4&gt;Generative AI engineers, prompt engineers, ML engineers, data scientists, AI/ML practitioners, and technical leaders in financial services will benefit most, especially those working with regulated AI use cases, model operations, and responsible deployment.&lt;h3 id="agenticaiunleashed"&gt;&lt;a id="agenticaiunleashed" href="https://cdn.humble.com/humblebundle/ops/pdfs/agenticaiunleashed_preview.pdf?t=st=1791690397~exp=1791776797~hmac=1e4e8996d73ee33bc6748fcd7d0e03474a1840355f4e83e0e430d74b361a612c"&gt;Agentic AI Unleashed&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/72704807c96e4451ff78e52b99d4d9ec7e9873a6.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=d1c40cfacf0a90929cd67e4044c249d2"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Key Features&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Agent design coverage spanning LLM cognitive cores, memory systems, tools, and integrations&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Engineering focus on lifecycle practices, performance optimization, testing, and observability&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Responsible production guidance linking deployment, security, ethics, and maintenance needs&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Who this book is for&lt;/h4&gt;Software developers, students, engineers, business leaders, and executives will benefit most, especially those building agentic AI products or making strategic decisions about autonomous AI systems and production investment.&lt;h3 id="potentialofgenerativeai"&gt;&lt;a id="potentialofgenerativeai" href="https://cdn.humble.com/humblebundle/ops/pdfs/potentialofgenerativeai_preview.pdf?t=st=1791690397~exp=1791776797~hmac=ebb939f8b6b3d0a94dc12d7de680179cbf654b67d9bc3dbee589468d08304aad"&gt;The Potential of Generative AI&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/e61850e24dec4b148b5a2981b1abac28292f8aa8.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=dc1c649a50899b4f28460195b199906c"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Key Features&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Generative model coverage across GANs, VAEs, text, images, music, design, and code creation&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Industry examples spanning healthcare, finance, entertainment, drug discovery, and products&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Creative productivity focus connecting ChatGPT, art, music, design, writing, and research work&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Who this book is for&lt;/h4&gt;Artists, programmers, musicians, designers, writers, researchers, entrepreneurs, scientists, machine learning practitioners, and other creative or technical learners will benefit most from this exploration of GenAI’s applications.&lt;h3 id="enterpriseguideforimplementinggenerativeaiandagenticai_bpb"&gt;&lt;a id="enterpriseguideforimplementinggenerativeaiandagenticai_bpb" href="https://cdn.humble.com/humblebundle/ops/pdfs/enterpriseguideforimplementinggenerativeaiandagenticai_bpb_preview.pdf?t=st=1791690397~exp=1791776797~hmac=91cfe7cb77df55eb095e56129515d72b9c23176afa5482a285eb89de0d44e537"&gt;Generative AI for Enterprises&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/933fbddffeabdaa329c4f3369eeea81456ee87a5.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=dfba468fb77d02d4ac4848bea73abe73"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Key Features&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Enterprise GenAI strategy coverage across LLM selection, LLMOps, RAG, MaaS, and cost controls&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Risk-aware guidance for ethics, myths, operating models, Confidential AI, and reputation impact&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Decision-maker lens on scaling GenAI workflows with orchestration and enterprise readiness&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Who this book is for&lt;/h4&gt;Decision makers and senior technology stakeholders will benefit most, including CIOs, CTOs, CAIOs, enterprise architects, chief engineers, and leaders responsible for GenAI implementation across organizations or client environments.&lt;h3 id="generativeaiwithlangchain_bpb"&gt;&lt;a id="generativeaiwithlangchain_bpb" href="https://cdn.humble.com/humblebundle/ops/pdfs/generativeaiwithlangchain_bpb_preview.pdf?t=st=1791690397~exp=1791776797~hmac=8994080cbedb4dd7f2feeb53348a0253b634e4a55c705a190b3865d8050207a0"&gt;Generative AI with LangChain&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/1516e6c2eab5bd018e7031c61b4a950f3172717f.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=4c16cb58d46152e1f79adb4f73037bce"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Key Features&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;LangChain-centered pathway covering AI foundations, Python, neural networks, and cloud tools&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Cloud integration focus with AWS, Azure, Snowflake, Athena, DevOps, and MLOps project contexts&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Ethical AI and future-trend coverage tied to scalable, data-driven application deployment plans&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Who this book is for&lt;/h4&gt;Software developers, AI enthusiasts, data scientists, DevOps engineers, technology professionals, educators, and computer science students will benefit most, especially those seeking practical LangChain implementation skills.&lt;h3 id="buildingmultimodalgenerativeaiandagenticapplications"&gt;&lt;a id="buildingmultimodalgenerativeaiandagenticapplications" href="https://cdn.humble.com/humblebundle/ops/pdfs/buildingmultimodalgenerativeaiandagenticapplications_preview.pdf?t=st=1791690397~exp=1791776797~hmac=11741e3dc5ac5bb952f6e27e5dc9ef1f0d9622adc1722856b7d2aff5fafdb088"&gt;Building Multimodal Generative AI and Agentic Applications&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/8c0e5f9295afab88d9b6c23a02c524d11b1be6c0.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=067ff3f0b6a98953e3e60d67d5dbcb10"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Key Features&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Multimodal scope across text, images, voice, data, and vision-language systems design patterns&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Agentic workflow coverage for RAG, vector databases, embeddings, cross-encoders, and planning&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Production-ready guidance on OCR, text-to-SQL, monitoring, observability, and hybrid AI systems&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Who this book is for&lt;/h4&gt;AI enthusiasts, data scientists, ML engineers, software developers, tech leads, researchers, and enterprise architects will benefit most. Foundational Python and ML knowledge is helpful for building and scaling multimodal, production-grade agentic AI systems.&lt;h3 id="generativeaiforhealthcare"&gt;&lt;a id="generativeaiforhealthcare" href="https://cdn.humble.com/humblebundle/ops/pdfs/generativeaiforhealthcare_preview.pdf?t=st=1791690397~exp=1791776797~hmac=a52e215ded5805f73b493849a597201603e7281fb15d35d6c8bc8841f8dc5d1d"&gt;Generative AI for Healthcare&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/49f867931bf0408bf13bc7b9fcc25e3a009c6192.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=2a3b879eb435aae86bb1b4193c851f52"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Key Features&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Healthcare AI scope across diagnostics, imaging, synthetic patient data, and personalized care&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Guidance for payers, providers, life sciences, fraud detection, wellness apps, and strategy&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Compliance-aware coverage of privacy, ethical AI, HIPAA, GDPR, and future clinical innovation&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Who this book is for&lt;/h4&gt;Healthcare professionals, technology leaders, and business executives looking to understand or implement generative AI in healthcare will benefit most. Basic familiarity with healthcare operations, data management, or AI concepts is helpful but not required.&lt;/div&gt;</description>
