ogram interface and a&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Now, this is faster and easier than ever before.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;NEW FEATURES&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt; NEW! Object selection in the preview monitor - Stop searching objects cumbersomely&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt; NEW! Optimized zoom function - Refine your editing with the precise zoom function&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt; NEW! Chroma Key - Hide color ranges and replace si&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt; NEW! AV1 Import/Export - Effective compression with consistent excellent quality&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;HIGHLIGHTS&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt; Photo show software with extensive image editing and video editing functions&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt; Helpful assistants like the Photostory Wizard and the fast 1-click image optimization&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt; Practical panorama storyboard for best preview quality and more overlook&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt; Numerous design elements, such as creative collages, zoom and camera rides, intros/outros and high-quality title and cutting templates&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt; Output in 4K UHD – for prickly sharp photostorys&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3 id="photomanager17deluxe"&gt;&lt;a id="photomanager17deluxe"&gt;Photo Manager 17 deluxe&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/76e87e6ce36cded6aac7aaa565c7232483ef5922.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=50a5c7e19eafe9d184d09a051ad533f5"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Your images – organized and optimized&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;From snapshot to finished picture: Stay organized every step of the way! The new design of MAGIX Photo&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Manager Deluxe makes working with your digital photos and archiving videos faster and easier. Optimize your&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;image collections, easily keep track of photos and videos, protect your media from unwanted access and&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;present everything on your PC, on the Internet or on your mobile device. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;HIGHLIGHTS&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt; Cloud Import