al Engine (5.0 – 5.6) • Blender (Eevee, Cycles) • Unity (Built-In &amp;amp; HDRP) • Houdini (Mantra, Karma) • Cinema 4D  • Autodesk Maya, 3ds Max • Octane, Redshift, V-Ray, Arnold&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="mechwarsdropship"&gt;&lt;a id="mechwarsdropship"&gt;Mech Wars Drop Ship&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/4e46fa0f0438b0fa639f46962736fa15ae45a7a8.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=5f69ee67662f6801a768f406ced9a0fa"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Deliver Troops and deploy chaos with this ship standing at 14.50 meters in cale with 17 PBR materials&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Fast, rugged, and ready for planetfall, the Dropship is your go-to vessel for tactical insertions and combat drops.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Featuring reinforced landing gear, compact armor, and room for a full squad, this ship adds motion, urgency, and cinematic impact to your sci-fi ground invasions.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Features:  • 14.50 Meters In Scale / High Quality Vehicle  • 17 PBR Materials • Compatible with Windows, Mac and All Major Software&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Texture Sizes: • 1K, 2K and 4K&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Supported Software: • Unreal Engine (5.0 – 5.5) • Blender (Eevee, Cycles) • Unity (Built-In &amp;amp; HDRP) • Houdini (Mantra, Karma) • Cinema 4D  • Autodesk Maya, 3ds Max • Octane, Redshift, V-Ray, Arnold&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</description>
