ready claiming the audience. Don't miss out!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="buildtwitch-controlledgodotgamesfirst-timeexclusivehumblebundlerel"&gt;&lt;a id="buildtwitch-controlledgodotgamesfirst-timeexclusivehumblebundlerel" href="https://youtu.be/9RRjFdD5ojM"&gt;Build Twitch-Controlled Godot Games&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/77f3d842b90d8c787eba56fdf322e70767a55b9c.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=4488035419a0687a2e60d74c16db5c5c"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Let the chat play the game. This video course builds 2 Godot games controlled by Twitch viewers.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;You'll get Twitch credentials, connect to the broadcaster's chat, and turn messages into gameplay.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Building an app on the Twitch Developers Console.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Creating a user access token with the implicit grant flow.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Connecting to broadcaster chat to control the game.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Getting the logged-in streamer identity automatically with OAuth.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Game 1 is a boss battle from a provided starter project. Game 2 has chat picking sides in an army battle.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Lifetime access to all modules.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Source files included&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Certificate of completion&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Your next stream could be the one people talk about. Enroll today!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="gameanalyticsforsolodevelopersfirst-timeexclusivehumblebundlerelea"&gt;&lt;a id="gameanalyticsforsolodevelopersfirst-timeexclusivehumblebundlerelea" href="https://youtu.be/9RRjFdD5ojM"&gt;Game Analytics for Solo Developers &lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/5a1009717686e18e2982c3bca13ee81ee1866695.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=d69f40434e3a6abd69b2f647f445fc20"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Solo developers rarely have an analytics team. This video course covers tracking and reading game data on your own.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;You'll learn what to measure and what the numbers tell you.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► What to track in your game.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Setting up analytics as a solo developer.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Reading player behavior data.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Acting on what the numbers show.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Guessing what players do is expensive. Measuring is cheaper.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Lifetime access to all modules.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Source files included&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Certificate of completion&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Every week without data is a week of guessing. Start now!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="buildingabrandmarketingontiktokandinstagram"&gt;&lt;a id="buildingabrandmarketingontiktokandinstagram" href="https://youtu.be/9RRjFdD5ojM"&gt;Building a Brand Marketing on TikTok and Instagram&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/1336504c856ae9a1c510a6b86fb2e4ad5fc1c2b3.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=e76e2618132598db57f11942cb0412cc"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Brands that work on TikTok and Instagram follow patterns you can copy. This video course breaks down what those patterns are.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;You'll study case studies, then apply trend tracking, content structure, and growth tactics.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► What makes a brand stand out, with iconic brand case studies.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► TikTok trends that drive traffic and how the Instagram algorithm works.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► The 3 pillars of content that converts, plus formats and calls to action.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Follower growth, cross-promotion, and community engagement.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Resources are included with each module.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Lifetime access to all modules.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Source files included&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Certificate of completion&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Trends move fast and waiting costs you reach. Join the herd.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="paidadsmastery_googlemetaandtiktokadvertisingthatconverts"&gt;&lt;a id="paidadsmastery_googlemetaandtiktokadvertisingthat